def author(c,s,m,a):
 c('b231','澆塊熱歷程、層面品質與重力壩荷載路徑~Block thermal histories, lift-joint quality and gravity-dam load paths',['usace-gravity','usbr-gravity','usace-rcc'],r'''
絕熱溫升與膠結材~Adiabatic rise and binder heat||大體積混凝土內部散熱慢，膠結材水化熱會累積。絕熱溫升把放熱量和材料熱容量連結，但真實澆塊還有表面交換、骨材溫度與時間效應。~Heat accumulates inside mass concrete because dissipation is slow. Adiabatic rise links binder heat to material heat capacity, while actual blocks also exchange heat at surfaces and depend on aggregate temperature and time.||假設膠結材180 kg/m³、累積放熱250 kJ/kg、混凝土體積熱容量2.4 MJ/(m³·K)，絕熱溫升18.75 K；不是實際峰值溫度。~Assume binder 180 kg/m³, cumulative heat 250 kJ/kg and volumetric heat capacity 2.4 MJ/(m³·K). Adiabatic rise is 18.75 K, not the actual peak temperature.||以材料量熱試驗取得放熱歷線，核對膠結材來源與配比，再比較澆塊中心與表面溫度；用能量平衡檢查溫度初值，並分列模板、氣溫與冷卻邊界。~Obtain heat-release histories from calorimetry, checking binder source and mixture proportions. Compare block-core and surface temperatures, verify initial conditions by energy balance, and list formwork, air-temperature and cooling boundaries separately.||把最終總放熱瞬間施加會錯估早期峰值，忽略表面散熱則會過度保守或失去梯度資訊。相同膠結材用量也不保證不同配方具有相同放熱速率。~Applying ultimate heat instantly misstates early peaks, while neglecting surface loss removes gradient information. Equal binder content also does not guarantee equal heat-release rates across different cementitious formulations.||絕熱溫升就是工地澆塊必定量到的最高溫度。~Adiabatic temperature rise is the highest temperature that every placed block must reach.
澆置供應與冷縫風險~Placement supply and cold joints||分塊澆築要求連續供料與有序覆蓋，供應率不足會延長新舊料接觸時間。總日產量達標不代表每一局部層面都在可接受條件下接續。~Block placement needs continuous supply and orderly coverage. Insufficient delivery prolongs local intervals between layers, so meeting daily output does not establish acceptable continuity at every local interface.||假設澆塊600 m³、有效供應率75 m³/h，純澆置需8 h；若停機1.5 h則9.5 h，未計振實和局部覆蓋順序。~Assume block volume 600 m³ and effective supply 75 m³/h. Placement requires eight hours, or 9.5 h with a 1.5 h outage, excluding local compaction and coverage sequence.||按位置記錄每批到達與覆蓋時間，對照氣溫、坍度與凝結資料；將供料停頓映射到實際層面，另以取芯或指定界面試驗檢查接續品質，而非只查總方量。~Record delivery and covering times by location and compare temperature, workability and setting data. Map supply interruptions to actual interfaces, then examine joint quality with cores or specified interface tests rather than total volume alone.||同一停機時間在不同溫度下會產生不同接縫狀態，盲目加水恢復工作性又會改變材料品質。若只補足少澆的方量，已形成的弱層不會自動消失。~The same interruption produces different interface states at different temperatures, and adding water to restore workability changes material quality. Making up missing volume does not automatically remove an already formed weak layer.||只要最後總澆置方量正確，局部冷縫就不會影響壩體。~Correct final placed volume means local cold joints cannot affect the dam.
層面剪力與有效正應力~Lift-joint shear and effective stress||水平施工層面傳遞剪力，黏聚、摩擦與孔壓共同控制可動員阻力。層面清理和骨材嵌固影響黏結，不能用完整混凝土強度直接代表接縫。~Horizontal lift joints transfer shear through cohesion and friction under effective normal stress. Cleaning and aggregate interlock affect bond, so intact-concrete strength cannot directly represent the interface.||假設層面面積100 m²、總正力30 MN、上浮10 MN、c=0.1 MPa、μ=0.6，阻力cA+μ(N−U)=22 MN；參數為假設峰值。~Assume interface area 100 m², normal force 30 MN, uplift 10 MN, c=0.1 MPa and μ=0.6. Resistance cA+μ(N−U)=22 MN, using assumed peak parameters.||以層面取芯與剪切試驗核對黏結及粗糙度，將孔壓測站換算到相同層位；分列峰值與殘餘參數，檢查抗力式是否對應實際可用接觸面積。~Check bond and roughness with interface cores and shear testing, referring piezometers to the same lift. Separate peak and residual parameters and verify that the resistance formula uses the actual available contact area.||漿皮或污染使層面黏結降低，孔壓增加又削弱摩擦項。若在可能開裂的接縫仍無條件保留黏聚力，會高估滑動後阻力並掩蓋排水功能的重要性。~Laitance or contamination reduces bond, while pore pressure reduces friction. Retaining cohesion unconditionally after possible cracking overstates post-movement resistance and obscures the importance of drainage performance.||接縫剪力能力可以直接等同完整混凝土的強度。~A construction-joint shear capacity directly equals intact-concrete strength.
熱擴散與澆塊尺寸~Thermal diffusion and block dimensions||熱擴散時間大致與傳熱距離平方成正比，澆塊尺度增加會讓中心維持高溫更久。這個尺度關係說明分塊原因，但不能給出精確冷卻完成時間。~Thermal diffusion time scales approximately with the square of travel distance, so larger blocks retain core heat longer. This explains the value of subdivision without predicting an exact cooling-completion time.||假設熱擴散係數α=10⁻⁶ m²/s、特徵距離2 m，t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days；僅尺度估算，不是指定等待期。~Assume diffusivity α=10⁻⁶ m²/s and characteristic distance 2 m. t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days, a scale estimate rather than a prescribed waiting period.||比較不同深度溫度變化的相位與幅度，以實測材料導熱率和熱容量重建擴散係數；將冷卻管、表面邊界和新增澆層列入，檢查單一距離是否具代表性。~Compare temperature phase and amplitude at several depths and derive diffusivity from measured conductivity and heat capacity. Include cooling pipes, surface conditions and added lifts, testing whether one characteristic distance is representative.||用半厚或全厚當距離會造成四倍時間差，必須與邊界定義一致。後續澆層改變表面散熱條件，原本冷卻中的塊體可能再升溫，不能只外推初期曲線。~Using half-thickness versus full thickness changes the time scale fourfold and must match boundary definitions. Later lifts alter heat loss and can reheat a cooling block, invalidating simple extrapolation of early records.||澆塊厚度加倍只會讓熱擴散時間加倍。~Doubling block thickness only doubles the thermal diffusion time.
冷卻水能量移除~Cooling-water heat removal||埋管冷卻以水流帶走熱量，進出口溫差與流量共同決定移熱率。大流量低溫差和小流量高溫差不能只憑其中一項判斷效果。~Embedded cooling removes heat through water flow, with inlet-outlet temperature difference and flow jointly determining removal. Neither flow nor temperature rise alone establishes cooling performance.||假設水流2 kg/s、比熱4.18 kJ/(kg·K)、升溫5 K，移熱率41.8 kW；持續24 h移除3.61152 GJ，忽略流量溫差變化。~Assume water flow 2 kg/s, heat capacity 4.18 kJ/(kg·K) and rise 5 K. Heat removal is 41.8 kW or 3.61152 GJ over 24 h at constant conditions.||同步量測各迴路進出口溫度和流量，積分移熱量與壩內溫度下降比較；檢查旁通、儀器偏差與管路漏水，避免只以泵流量代替真正穿過埋管的流量。~Measure temperature and flow in each circuit synchronously and compare integrated removal with internal cooling. Check bypasses, instrument bias and leaks instead of using pump discharge as the flow through embedded pipes.||冷卻過快可能加大局部溫差和拉應力，不是移熱越多就越好。進出口感測器零點差也會在小溫差時造成大比例誤差，掩蓋實際冷卻不足。~Excessively fast cooling increases local gradients and tension, so more heat removal is not always better. Sensor offset between inlet and outlet causes large relative errors at small differences and can conceal inadequate removal.||只要冷卻水流量夠大，便能保證混凝土沒有溫差裂縫。~Sufficiently high cooling-water flow guarantees freedom from thermal-gradient cracking.
成熟度與強度校正~Maturity and strength calibration||成熟度把時間和溫度整合為水化歷程指標，必須經同配比強度校正才可推論能力。不同膠結材或養護濕度會改變關係，不能把成熟度當直接強度。~Maturity combines time and temperature into a hydration-history index and needs same-mixture calibration before implying strength. Binder and curing moisture change the relationship, so maturity is not strength itself.||假設Nurse-Saul基準溫度−10°C，混凝土20°C維持48 h，M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h；未由此指定任何MPa。~Assume Nurse-Saul datum −10°C and concrete at 20°C for 48 h. M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h, without assigning any strength in MPa.||用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。~Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages. Check moisture curing and high-temperature exposure against the calibration range and retain direct tensile and compressive tests.||高早期溫度可能改變後期強度發展，乾燥也可能中斷水化。若以其他配方成熟度曲線套用，會產生看似精確但缺乏材料依據的承載判讀。~High early temperature can alter later strength development, and drying can interrupt hydration. Borrowing another mixture maturity curve creates apparently precise capacity estimates without the required material-specific evidence.||成熟度達到固定數字就代表所有混凝土具有同一強度。~A fixed maturity value means every concrete mixture has the same strength.
接縫開度與止水變形~Joint opening and waterstop deformation||澆塊收縮使接縫開度改變，止水需要承受法向張開及剪向錯動。只量接縫寬度無法代表三維變形，也不能以材料伸長率直接代替完整接頭性能。~Block contraction changes joint opening, while waterstops face both normal opening and shear offset. Width alone misses three-dimensional movement, and material elongation is not complete-joint performance.||假設有效收縮長20 m、熱膨脹係數10⁻⁵/K、降溫12 K，自由收縮2.4 mm；忽略拘束與相鄰塊共同變形，非止水容許開度。~Assume effective contraction length 20 m, expansion coefficient 10⁻⁵/K and cooling 12 K. Free contraction is 2.4 mm, excluding restraint and neighboring-block movement and not an allowable waterstop opening.||使用多方向接縫計核對張開與剪移，對照兩側溫度和庫水壓；檢查止水埋設位置與接頭試驗是否相符，並用分區漏流辨認局部通道。~Use multi-axis joint meters to separate opening and shear, comparing temperatures and reservoir pressure. Check waterstop placement against tested joint geometry and use sectional leakage observations to locate preferential paths.||止水扭曲或接合不良可能在開度不大時漏水，混凝土蜂窩也會繞過完整止水。若只以接縫平均寬度判斷，會漏掉局部錯動與埋設缺陷。~Twisted or poorly joined waterstops may leak at small openings, while honeycombing bypasses an intact strip. Average joint width misses local shear offsets and defects in embedded placement.||接縫平均開度很小就能保證止水一定不會漏水。~A small mean joint opening guarantees that the waterstop cannot leak.
模板側壓與澆置狀態~Form pressure and placement state||新拌混凝土對模板的側壓取決於澆置速率、凝結與振動，短時間內可近似液體。把已硬化混凝土的側向性質拿來估新拌壓力會嚴重失真。~Fresh-concrete form pressure depends on placing rate, setting and vibration and may initially approximate a liquid. Hardened-concrete lateral behavior cannot represent the fresh material pressure field.||假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa；每米寬合力γh²/2=108 kN/m，作靜水上界示例。~Assume fresh-concrete unit weight 24 kN/m³ and effective fluid height 3 m. Base pressure is 72 kPa and resultant per width is 108 kN/m, as a hydrostatic-bound example.||核對澆置速率、料溫與凝結試驗，將模板壓力計讀數按高度作圖；檢查振動期間峰值與拉桿反力，並確認壓力假設涵蓋實際材料工作性。~Check placing rate, temperature and setting tests and plot measured form pressures by elevation. Examine vibration-related peaks and tie reactions, confirming that pressure assumptions cover the actual mixture workability.||延緩凝結或重新振動可能延長液態壓力作用，局部供料堆高也會增加側壓。只按平均澆築高估算而忽略局部集中，會低估模板與拉桿需求。~Retarded setting or revibration can prolong fluid-like pressure, while local placement piles increase head. Average lift height can miss local concentrations and understate demand on formwork and ties.||混凝土剛澆入就已完全自立，所以模板不承受液態側壓。~Freshly placed concrete is immediately self-supporting and exerts no fluid-like form pressure.
上浮折減與抗滑~Uplift reduction and sliding||重力壩的自重提供摩擦抗滑，但基底上浮降低有效正向力。排水效果需由孔壓驗證，不能因設計有排水孔就自動採取最大折減。~Gravity-dam weight provides frictional resistance, but uplift reduces effective normal force. Drainage effectiveness requires pressure evidence rather than an automatic maximum reduction because drains appear on drawings.||假設每米壩段重量12 MN/m、上浮3 MN/m、μ=0.7、水平推力4 MN/m，純摩擦比μ(W−U)/H=1.575；未含黏聚與地震。~Assume per-metre weight 12 MN/m, uplift 3 MN/m, μ=0.7 and horizontal force 4 MN/m. Friction-only ratio μ(W−U)/H=1.575, excluding cohesion and earthquake loading.||沿基底量測孔壓並積分上浮，對照排水量和庫位變化；確認滑動面位置、材料參數與荷載組合一致，再比較排水減弱時的敏感度，而非只驗一個數字。~Integrate measured basal pressure into uplift and compare drainage and reservoir changes. Keep slip plane, material parameters and load combination consistent, then assess sensitivity to impaired drainage instead of checking one ratio alone.||排水量變小可能代表堵塞而非更防水，孔壓升高會讓摩擦比降低。若把排水孔附近低壓當整個基底均值，會過度樂觀估計有效重量與抗滑能力。~Lower drainage may indicate clogging rather than improved impermeability, and rising pressure lowers frictional reserve. Extrapolating low pressure beside drains across the whole base overstates effective weight and sliding resistance.||圖面有排水孔就能不量孔壓而忽略全部基底上浮。~Drains shown on drawings allow all foundation uplift to be ignored without pressure measurements.
澆塊幾何與材料追溯~Block geometry and material traceability||分塊施工讓每一批混凝土對應空間位置，幾何方量與材料紀錄可互相驗證。超澆、孔洞和預留廊道會影響方量，不能用進料量直接當完成實體。~Block construction links concrete batches to spatial locations, enabling geometric and material records to cross-check. Overpour, voids and galleries affect volume, so delivered material is not automatically completed solid geometry.||假設矩形澆塊20×15×2 m，扣除廊道30 m³，淨量570 m³；若供料590 m³，差20 m³須查損耗和幾何，不能直接稱空洞。~Assume block 20×15×2 m minus gallery 30 m³, giving net 570 m³. Delivery 590 m³ leaves a 20 m³ difference requiring geometry and loss checks, not an automatic void diagnosis.||把測量面、預留件和批次進料分別建帳，核對每車時間與澆築位置；以收方幾何、廢料紀錄和密度試驗做閉合，對不能解釋的差異要求獨立查證。~Maintain separate surveyed surfaces, embedded-volume and delivery records, matching batches to placement location. Close quantities using as-built geometry, waste records and density tests, requiring independent evidence for unexplained differences.||把運輸損耗或模板外擴誤判為內部空洞會導致錯誤調查，反過來總量吻合也可能掩蓋局部蜂窩。空間追溯能找出缺陷位置，總方量卻無法。~Transport loss or form bulging can be mistaken for voids, while matching total volume can conceal local honeycombing. Spatial traceability can locate defects, whereas aggregate quantity cannot resolve their distribution.||進料總方量與設計相符就能證明澆塊內完全沒有缺陷。~Matching delivered and design volume proves the entire block is defect-free.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'180*250/2400',18.75,'K'),(2,'600/75+1.5',9.5,'h'),(3,'.1*100+.6*(30-10)',22,'MN'),(4,'2**2/1e-6/86400',46.296296,'days'),(5,'2*4.18*5*86400/1e6',3.61152,'GJ'),(6,'(20+10)*48',1440,'C h'),(7,'20*1e-5*12*1000',2.4,'mm'),(8,'24*3**2/2',108,'kN/m'),(9,'.7*(12-3)/4',1.575,'ratio'),(10,'20*15*2-30',570,'m3')]:a('b231',i,ex,out,un)
 c('b232','碾壓層密實、材料配比與層間滲流的品質鏈~Quality links between RCC compaction, mixture proportions and interlift seepage',['usace-rcc','usace-gravity','usbr-gravity'],r'''
鋪層體積與供料節拍~Lift volume and supply rhythm||碾壓混凝土以薄層連續鋪築形成大體積結構，層面暴露時間由面積和供料節拍共同決定。設備名義產能不等於可持續有效供料，需考慮運輸與等待。~RCC forms mass structures through thin successive lifts. Lift exposure depends on area and delivery rhythm, while rated plant capacity differs from sustainable placement because transport and queuing intervene.||假設鋪層面積5000 m²、厚0.3 m，體積1500 m³；有效供料250 m³/h需6 h，未含邊緣修整和局部停頓。~Assume lift area 5000 m² and thickness 0.3 m, giving 1500 m³. Effective supply 250 m³/h requires six hours, excluding edge work and local interruptions.||以實際出料、運輸到達和攤鋪位置時間戳重建節拍，核對最久暴露區；將廠拌能力與運輸瓶頸分開，再用現場層面狀況檢查排程假設是否成立。~Reconstruct rhythm from batching, arrival and placement timestamps and identify the longest-exposed area. Separate batching capacity from transport bottlenecks, then check scheduling assumptions against actual interface conditions.||大面積整層平均完成很快仍可能有角落長時間未覆蓋，臨時道路交錯也會造成局部延遲。若以最高一小時產量推算全日，便會低估冷縫風險。~A fast average lift cycle can conceal long exposure in corners, while crossing haul routes cause local delays. Extrapolating the best production hour to a full day understates cold-interface risk.||拌合廠額定產能就是每個澆築位置可持續取得的供料率。~Rated batching capacity equals sustainable delivery at every placement location.
壓實度與參考密度~Compaction and reference density||RCC密實程度影響孔隙、強度與滲透性，現場密度需對應代表性參考值。參考試體的含水量與級配不同時，密實度百分比會失去可比性。~RCC density influences voids, strength and permeability, and field density needs a representative reference. A percentage loses comparability if reference specimens differ in moisture or grading from the placed material.||假設現場乾密度2320 kg/m³、參考最大乾密度2400 kg/m³，密實度96.667%；僅教學比例，不作任何工程驗收標準。~Assume field dry density 2320 kg/m³ and reference maximum dry density 2400 kg/m³. Relative compaction is 96.667 percent, a teaching ratio rather than an acceptance criterion.||用同配比試驗確認參考密度，核對現場量測含水修正與大骨材影響；以取芯密度、孔隙和強度作交叉檢查，並將邊緣與中部樣本分組。~Establish reference density for the same mixture, checking moisture correction and large-aggregate effects in field measurements. Cross-check with core density, voids and strength, grouping edge and interior samples separately.||密度計校正偏差可能讓全層數字一致但錯誤，粗骨材集中又會改變局部讀數。只驗平均密實度可能漏掉層底或模板附近的連續鬆散帶。~Calibration bias can make all readings consistently wrong, while coarse-aggregate concentration changes local response. Mean compaction alone can miss continuous loose bands at lift bottoms or beside forms.||平均密實度達到要求就代表層內每個位置都同樣密實。~Meeting mean compaction requirements means every location is equally dense.
含水量與膠結比~Moisture and water-binder ratio||含水不足會降低可壓實性，過多則改變骨架和漿體孔隙。總水量需含骨材自由水，不能只看拌合機外加水；吸收水與自由水的角色不同。~Too little water impairs compactability, while excess changes the aggregate skeleton and paste voids. Total mixing water includes aggregate free moisture, with absorbed and free water serving different roles.||假設膠結材150 kg/m³、設計有效水90 kg/m³，w/b=0.60；骨材帶入自由水15 kg/m³時，外加水應為75 kg/m³，限已知吸水修正。~Assume binder 150 kg/m³ and effective water 90 kg/m³, giving w/b=0.60. Aggregate free water 15 kg/m³ leaves added water 75 kg/m³, with absorption already accounted for.||分別量測骨材含水和吸水率，核對外加水計量與批次修正；比較稠度、壓實反應和取芯品質，確認比例變化不是單純由濕骨材質量換算錯誤造成。~Measure aggregate moisture and absorption separately and check metered additions and batch corrections. Compare consistency, compaction response and cores to ensure apparent ratio changes are not wet-mass conversion errors.||把吸收水全部當成可用拌合水會低估外加需求，雨後自由水未扣除則會提高有效水膠比。現場補水若未記錄，後續強度異常將難以追溯。~Counting absorbed water as free mixing water understates additions, while failing to subtract rainwater increases effective ratio. Unrecorded field water makes later strength anomalies difficult to trace to their origin.||只記錄外加水就足以準確得到混凝土有效水膠比。~Added water alone accurately determines the concrete effective water-binder ratio.
壓實功與遍數解讀~Compaction effort and pass count||碾壓遍數是施工過程指標，不是材料狀態本身；振幅、頻率、速度、層厚及骨材都影響輸入和傳遞。增加遍數可能使密度趨於平台或造成粒料破碎。~Pass count describes process rather than material state. Amplitude, frequency, speed, thickness and aggregate affect energy transfer, while extra passes may reach a density plateau or crush particles.||假設單遍等效輸入能量20 kJ/m²、6遍、層厚0.3 m，名義能量密度400 kJ/m³；不代表全部能量有效傳入混凝土。~Assume equivalent input 20 kJ/m² per pass, six passes and lift thickness 0.3 m. Nominal energy density is 400 kJ/m³, not entirely effective energy delivered to concrete.||在試驗鋪層逐遍記錄密度與沉降，核對設備設定和行走路線；比較層底取芯與表面讀數，並檢查增加遍數後級配是否因骨材破碎而改變。~Record density and settlement after each pass on a trial lift, checking settings and travel paths. Compare bottom cores with surface readings and inspect whether extra passes alter grading through aggregate breakage.||表面密度達平台可能只是上部已密實而底部仍鬆散，遍數紀錄也可能因路徑重疊計算錯誤。把更多碾壓視為必然改善，會忽略破碎和離析。~A surface-density plateau may conceal a loose lower lift, and overlapping paths can distort pass counts. Assuming more rolling always improves quality overlooks particle breakage and segregation caused by excessive working.||碾壓遍數越多就必然讓所有深度的品質持續提高。~More roller passes necessarily keep improving quality at every depth.
砂漿體積與骨架空隙~Mortar volume and skeleton voids||骨材骨架需要足夠砂漿填充空隙並形成黏結，砂漿過少可能留下連通孔隙。粗骨材堆積密度與級配影響所需體積，不能只以水泥重量評估。~The aggregate skeleton needs mortar to fill voids and bond particles. Insufficient mortar can leave connected porosity, while packing density and grading control volume demand rather than cement mass alone.||假設每立方公尺粗骨材骨架空隙0.28 m³、有效砂漿0.31 m³，體積餘裕0.03 m³，即空隙的10.714%；不代表最佳配比。~Assume coarse-skeleton voids 0.28 m³ per bulk cubic metre and effective mortar 0.31 m³. Margin is 0.03 m³, or 10.714 percent of void volume, not an optimum mix.||量測骨材堆積空隙並核對砂漿實際體積，將細料吸附與骨材形狀一起考慮；用取芯孔隙連通性和界面觀察檢查是否真正填滿，而不是只看外觀。~Measure aggregate packing voids and actual mortar volume, considering fines adsorption and particle shape. Use core connectivity and interface observations to verify filling instead of relying on a smooth surface appearance.||砂漿充足不保證運輸後仍均勻分布，離析可在局部留下缺漿粗料。過多細料又可能增加需水與收縮，單一體積餘裕不能證明耐久性全面提升。~Adequate total mortar does not ensure uniform distribution after transport; segregation can leave locally deficient coarse pockets. Excess fines increase water demand and shrinkage, so one volume margin does not demonstrate overall durability.||總砂漿體積足夠就能保證每個局部空隙都被填滿。~Sufficient total mortar volume guarantees every local void is filled.
層間黏結與有效齡期~Interlift bond and exposure age||相鄰層的黏結受暴露溫度、時間、表面乾燥與處理影響，不只是日曆時間。等效齡期可比較熱歷程，但接縫強度仍需同材料與同處理試驗。~Interlift bond depends on exposure temperature, duration, drying and treatment rather than clock time alone. Equivalent age compares thermal histories, while bond strength still needs tests of the same materials and interface preparation.||假設簡化反應速率每升10 K加倍，基準20°C，30°C暴露4 h相當20°C的8 h；僅教學Q10模型，非接縫接受時間。~Assume a simplified reaction rate doubling per ten kelvin above 20°C. Four hours at 30°C equals eight hours at 20°C, a teaching Q10 model rather than an interface acceptance time.||將表面溫度、覆蓋時間和乾燥程度逐區記錄，用同條件層面試件量測黏結；比較表面處理前後結果，並檢查Q10近似是否超出校正溫度範圍。~Record surface temperature, covering time and drying by area and test bond using matched interface specimens. Compare preparation conditions and verify that the Q10 approximation remains within its calibrated temperature range.||相同等效齡期下，受雨沖刷或污染的層面仍可能有不同黏結。把化學反應速度直接當作力學強度，會忽略粗糙度、乾燥和界面缺漿的作用。~At equal equivalent age, washed or contaminated interfaces can still bond differently. Equating reaction speed with mechanical strength ignores roughness, drying and local mortar deficiency at the interface.||等效齡期相同就能保證不同表面條件的層面黏結相同。~Equal equivalent age guarantees equal bond despite different interface conditions.
層狀滲透異向性~Layered permeability anisotropy||薄層界面可能沿水平方向形成較易滲流的通道，垂直試體低滲透不代表整壩各方向相同。層狀介質的等效滲透率須依平行或垂直流向計算。~Lift interfaces can create easier horizontal seepage paths, so low vertical specimen permeability does not establish isotropy. Equivalent permeability of layers differs for flow parallel and perpendicular to them.||假設等厚兩層k1=10⁻⁸、k2=10⁻⁶ m/s，平行ke=(k1+k2)/2=5.05×10⁻⁷ m/s，垂直調和平均1.9802×10⁻⁸ m/s。~Assume equal layers with k1=10⁻⁸ and k2=10⁻⁶ m/s. Parallel permeability is 5.05×10⁻⁷ m/s and perpendicular harmonic mean is 1.9802×10⁻⁸ m/s.||按層面平行和垂直方向取樣試驗，核對飽和程度和試驗水頭；把排水出流位置與層面分布疊合，並檢查裂縫流是否已超出均質達西模型。~Test specimens parallel and perpendicular to lifts, checking saturation and applied head. Overlay drain locations with interfaces and determine whether fracture flow has exceeded the assumptions of a homogeneous Darcy model.||單一方向芯樣可能避開連續弱層，低試驗水頭也未必揭露開裂後通道。若把實驗室完整小試體結果直接代表整壩，會低估尺度與界面影響。~A specimen orientation may miss continuous weak layers, and low head may not reveal post-cracking paths. Directly extrapolating intact small specimens to the dam understates scale and interface effects.||垂直芯樣滲透率很低就證明水平層面也同樣不透水。~Low vertical-core permeability proves equally low permeability along horizontal lift interfaces.
上下游面層協調~Facing and RCC compatibility||面層和內部RCC可能具有不同彈性、收縮與溫度歷程，接合區需傳遞相對變形。外表平整不能證明內部相容，尤其在澆置時間錯開時。~Facing and interior RCC can differ in stiffness, shrinkage and temperature history, requiring their interface to accommodate relative movement. A smooth exterior does not establish compatibility, especially with different placement times.||假設兩材料自由收縮差150 microstrain、接合長10 m，差異位移1.5 mm；自由變形估算，不含拘束應力與裂縫分配。~Assume free-shrinkage difference 150 microstrain across bonded length 10 m. Differential movement is 1.5 mm, excluding restraint stress and crack distribution.||同步量測面層與內部溫度和應變，核對澆置齡期及養護差異；利用界面取芯和裂縫分布檢查相容性，將自由收縮資料與受拘束現場資料分開比較。~Measure facing and interior temperature and strain together, checking age and curing differences. Use interface cores and crack patterns to assess compatibility, comparing free-shrinkage specimens separately from restrained field behavior.||面層過早變硬可能拘束後續RCC收縮，缺乏黏結則可能形成漏流路徑。若只要求兩種材料各自強度達標，仍無法證明接合區能共同工作。~An early-stiffening facing can restrain later RCC shrinkage, while poor bond creates leakage paths. Separate strength compliance of both materials does not establish that their interface acts compatibly under service conditions.||面層和內部材料各自強度合格就代表接合區必然可靠。~Separate strength compliance of facing and RCC guarantees a reliable interface.
邊緣壓實與死角~Edge compaction and restricted zones||大型碾輪難以接近模板、廊道和埋件，邊緣區可能需要不同設備與工法。中部試驗成果不能直接代表受限空間，幾何可達性是品質控制的一部分。~Large rollers cannot fully approach forms, galleries and embedded items, so restricted zones need different equipment or methods. Central trial results do not represent these areas, making geometric access part of quality control.||假設長100 m的邊緣未充分覆蓋帶寬0.4 m、層厚0.3 m，受影響體積12 m³；占1500 m³一層的0.8%，不代表可忽略。~Assume a poorly covered edge band 100 m long, 0.4 m wide and 0.3 m thick. Volume is 12 m³, or 0.8 percent of a 1500 m³ lift, not necessarily negligible.||把設備軌跡與埋件位置疊合標出未覆蓋區，分區選取密度和芯樣；確認替代壓實工法有試驗證據，並檢查弱帶是否沿多個層次連續相接。~Overlay roller tracks with embedded items to locate uncovered areas and sample density and cores by zone. Verify alternative compaction with trials and check whether weak bands connect across successive lifts.||體積占比小但若沿上游形成連續通道，可能主導滲流而非平均強度。以隨機中部取樣代表全部工程，會系統性漏掉可達性不足造成的缺陷。~A small-volume band can dominate seepage if continuous near the upstream face. Random sampling confined to central areas systematically misses defects caused by restricted equipment access along the structure.||邊緣弱帶占總體積很小就不可能影響整壩防滲功能。~A small-volume weak edge band cannot affect the dams overall seepage performance.
強度抽樣與空間變異~Strength sampling and spatial variability||試體平均強度描述中心趨勢，離散程度和空間分布決定是否存在局部弱區。相同平均值可能對應完全不同品質穩定性，取樣須與施工批次對應。~Mean specimen strength describes central tendency, while variability and location reveal weak zones. Equal means can hide different consistency, so samples must be linked to placement batches and spatial positions.||假設強度平均20 MPa、標準差3 MPa，變異係數15%；採教學常態近似，第五百分位20−1.645×3=15.065 MPa，非規範設計值。~Assume mean strength 20 MPa and standard deviation 3 MPa, giving coefficient of variation fifteen percent. A teaching normal fifth percentile is 15.065 MPa, not a code design value.||保留每支試體位置、齡期與養護條件，畫批次和空間分布；檢查常態近似與樣本數是否合理，再以現場芯樣挑戰試體代表性，避免只報平均和最大值。~Retain specimen location, age and curing and plot batch and spatial distributions. Check sample size and normality, then challenge specimen representativeness with field cores rather than reporting only mean and maximum.||不同齡期混在一起會製造假離散，選擇性刪除低值又會掩蓋真正弱區。若忽略相鄰樣本相關性，統計信心可能被高估而無法代表整個澆築範圍。~Mixing ages creates false variability, while selectively deleting low results hides weak zones. Ignoring correlation between neighboring samples overstates statistical confidence and the extent represented by the testing programme.||平均強度相同就代表兩個施工區具有完全相同品質穩定性。~Equal mean strength means two construction zones have identical quality consistency.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'5000*.3/250',6,'h'),(2,'2320/2400*100',96.666667,'percent'),(3,'90-15',75,'kg/m3'),(4,'20*6/.3',400,'kJ/m3'),(5,'(.31-.28)/.28*100',10.7142857,'percent'),(6,'4*2**((30-20)/10)',8,'equivalent h'),(7,'2/(1/1e-8+1/1e-6)',1.980198e-8,'m/s'),(8,'150e-6*10*1000',1.5,'mm'),(9,'100*.4*.3/1500*100',.8,'percent'),(10,'20-1.645*3',15.065,'MPa')]:a('b232',i,ex,out,un)
